# F5's zoom, the scene in 320x200, from holomap.keys's save outside the
# prison: zoomed, a turn to the left, and back.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot outside
key F5
sleep 3
shot zoom
down Left
sleep 1
up Left
sleep 1
shot zoomwalk
key F5
sleep 3
shot unzoom
